    given-names: Liang
  - family-names: Tang
    given-names: Youbao
  - family-names: Fan
    given-names: Ruixi
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  CLASHarness (Conflict-Loaded Agent Scenario Harness) is a controllable
  generation framework and benchmark for synthesizing verifiable multi-agent
  conflict tasks in computer use. It evaluates how agents resolve temporal
  staleness, cross-modal discrepancies, and actionable delay over persistent
  simulated workflow state.
repository-code: https://github.com/google-research/CLASHarness
